/","us":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f3/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Simplificationalizer-virtue.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Simplificationalizer-virtue.wav.mp3"},"wordFamily":["by virtue of","in virtue of","cardinal virtue","dormitive virtue","in virtue of which","lady of light virtue","make a virtue of necessity","nonvirtue","patience is a virtue","pseudovirtue","unvirtue","virtuecrat","virtued","virtue ethicist","virtue ethics","virtue is its own reward","virtueless","virtue name","virtue signal","virtue signaler","virtue signaling","virtue-signaling","virtue signaller","virtue signalling","virtue-signalling","virtuous","woman of easy virtue"]}